msgctxt "96"
msgid "I have to admit, you're tough, Kiryu-kun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid "How can you react so quickly when you can't see?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "I use the air."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "The air? How?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "I can feel how the air is moving about. That serves as my eyes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"By sensing the direction the air is flowing in, I can pick up on even my "
"opponent's state of mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "In some ways, it's superior to conventional sight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Why is someone like you involved with the Reapers?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "I was looking for the man who made me blind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "When I lost my sight, I lost my livelihood as well, you see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"But now in hindsight, I realize being blind made me aware of so much more "
"than when I could see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"Not everything can be seen with the eyes. Maybe I should actually be "
"grateful he took my sight..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Well, a promise is a promise. Let's go to the HLA."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "Alright, lets go."
msgstr "Va bene, andiamo."

msgctxt "324"
msgid "What are you doing?"
msgstr "Che vuoi fare?"

msgctxt "336"
msgid "I'm blind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "This is the only way to get in touch with changes in the town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "372"
msgid "What do you want, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "You're the hitman Egami, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "And what if I am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "I'd like you to come with me to the Honest Living Association."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "The HLA, huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "And what might your name be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "It's Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Kiryu-kun, you've lied to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Lied?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"You said \"I'd like you to come with me,\" but I could tell you're already "
"prepared to fight me if need be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "You're ready to start trading punches. That's why you're so wound up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Isn't that right?"
msgstr "Giusto?"

msgctxt "528"
msgid "If you come along with me, we can avoid any unnecessary violence."
msgstr "Se vieni con me, possiamo evitare ogni violenza inutile."

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"Ah, I see. But I'm afraid I can't just let myself be taken away without "
"putting up a fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "If you wouldn't mind, could you humor me with a round?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "If I lose, then I'll do exactly as you say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "You don't leave me much choice. All right. Fine."
msgstr ""

